# Mobile Theater Production Guardrails

- Treat mobile theater as gesture-first playback UX.
- Do not add a bottom playback dock, floating center controls, or center timeline dots on mobile theater.
- On mobile, avoid rendering `ReelshortExperience` theater ambient/chrome overlays that can introduce floating center artifacts.
- Preserve touch controls on the video surface:
  - single tap: play/pause
  - horizontal slide: scrub seek
  - double tap left/right: -10s/+10s
  - double tap center: mute/unmute
- Keep landscape touch devices on mobile theater path (no desktop side-docked episode rail).
- Keep paid/free logic aligned to production: first 2 episodes free unless explicit metadata overrides.
- Treat Stripe subscription state as entitlement source using shared viewer entitlement helpers.
- For mobile theater changes, verify local phone behavior before production deploy.
